  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BaiBang Env&apos;l inv expansi</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BaiBang Milj&#xF6;investering</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Obunden kredit f&#xF6;r att finansiera milj&#xF6;investeringar i samband med planerad expansion vid BaiBangPaperCompany. M&#xE5;l med expansionen: &#xF6;ka massaproduktionen fr&#xE5;n 48000ton till 61000t och pappersproduktionen fr&#xE5;n 55000t till 100000t/&#xE5;r och f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra kvaliteten p&#xE5; producerade produkter. M&#xE5;l med milj&#xF6;investeringen: minska fabrikens milj&#xF6;utsl&#xE4;pp genom ytterligare investeringar i produktionsprocessen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Untied credit to finance environmental investments of the planned expansion at BaiBangPaperCompany. Main objective of expansion: increase pulp prod&apos;n from 48000ton to 61000t and paper prod&apos;n from 55000t to 100000t/year and improve quality of the produced products. Main objective of env&apos;l investment: reduce the plant&apos;s env&apos;l effluents by additional investments in the prod&apos;n process.</narrative>
  </description>
